                    (National Archives, Nixon Presidential
                    Materials, NSC Files, Kissinger Office Files, Box 70, Country Files,
                    Europe, USSR, Exchange of Notes Between
                        Dobrynin and Kissinger, Vol. 8)</p>
            </note>
